From 4010aa699a9acbc4aefc1fde2901539dcf6fc082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: howeasy <howardabudd@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:30:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] slink: similar-strength floor, global-map skip for fixed
 slots, overlay entries, HallOfFame starter sites

Review cx-795d1423 (1)(2)(3)(4): the BST-0 opaque sentinel hung the four
similar-strength searches and crashed the global 1-to-1 map; the SLink
companion-overlay builds had no entry and fell back to the vanilla offsets;
the HallOfFame starter comparison was not a starter site.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 FORK_CHANGES.md                               |  13 +
 .../pkrandom/config/gen1_offsets.ini          | 259 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../romhandlers/AbstractRomHandler.java       |  28 +-
 3 files changed, 286 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/FORK_CHANGES.md b/FORK_CHANGES.md
index ee89fdd..fde8b82 100644
--- a/FORK_CHANGES.md
+++ b/FORK_CHANGES.md
@@ -90,3 +90,16 @@ entries), so a vanilla `[Red (U)]`-style entry executes exactly the original cod
   gyms) have no effect there.
 - Move/item names are read for display only; TM description text is not rewritten (no `TMText[]`).
 - Forms/MissingNo show as "MISSINGNO" in the log.
+
+## Patch 9 — review cx-795d1423: sentinel hangs/crash, overlay entries, HallOfFame starter sites
+- `AbstractRomHandler.java`: the four similar-strength searches (`pickTrainerPokeReplacement`-style
+  loop at L6228, `pickReplacement` L6929, `pickWildPowerLvlReplacement` L6984, `pickStaticPowerLvlReplacement`
+  L7059) expand by `max(BST/20, 1)`: a fixed slot reaches them as the BST-0 opaque sentinel and expanded
+  by zero forever (wild similar / statics similar / trainers similar strength hung). Every real Pokemon
+  has BST >> 20, so vanilla output is unchanged. `randomEncounters()` L1237 (global 1-to-1) skips an
+  encounter that is not in the translate map (the sentinel is not an ordinary Pokemon): the writer never
+  touches that slot anyway; previously `setFormeForEncounter` dereferenced the null.
+- `config/gen1_offsets.ini`: `[PureRed overlay (U)]`/`[PureBlue overlay (U)]`/`[PureGreen overlay (U)]`
+  for the SLink companion-overlay builds (header CRCs 0xD3B7 / 0x0D7E / 0x0B94; banks 0/1/3 shifted).
+  Without them the exact-CRC lookup missed and the generic fallback chose the VANILLA Red/Blue entry.
+  `StarterOffsets1/2` gain the HallOfFame `cp STARTER1`/`cp STARTER2` operands (postgame ball-hide branch).
